<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 7 Discussion and Future Work ‣ EmoBench-Reddit: A Hierarchical Benchmark for Evaluating the Emotional Intelligence of Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limitations:</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 7 Discussion and Future Work ‣ EmoBench-Reddit: A Hierarchical Benchmark for Evaluating the Emotional Intelligence of Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Future Work:</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In EmoBench-Reddit: A Hierarchical Benchmark for Evaluating the Emotional Intelligence of Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In EmoBench-Reddit: A Hierarchical Benchmark for Evaluating the Emotional Intelligence of Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
